{"title": "MISS / HIT / EXPIRED 三态实测", "lines": [
  {"t": "cmd", "s": "curl -s -D - -o /dev/null \"localhost:8081/api/?id=1\" | grep X-Cache"},
  {"t": "out", "s": "X-Cache-Status: MISS"},
  {"t": "cmd", "s": "curl -s -D - -o /dev/null \"localhost:8081/api/?id=1\" | grep X-Cache"},
  {"t": "out", "s": "X-Cache-Status: HIT"},
  {"t": "note", "s": "HIT 期间后端 access.log 行数未变：没碰后端"},
  {"t": "note", "s": "TTL 3s 过后同一请求："},
  {"t": "cmd", "s": "curl -s -D - -o /dev/null \"localhost:8081/api/?id=1\" | grep X-Cache"},
  {"t": "out", "s": "X-Cache-Status: EXPIRED"},
  {"t": "note", "s": "实测：nginx:1.28-alpine 容器，proxy_cache_valid 200 3s"}
]}
